              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mbese hari uwahinyura imishinga? Kandi bazanezerwa babonye timazi mu ntoki za Zerubabeli, kandi ibyo birindwi ni byo maso y'Uwiteka acuragana mu isi yose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
