              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndongera ndamubaza nti “Iriya myelayo uko ari ibiri, umwe uri iburyo bw'igitereko cy'amatabaza, undi ukaba ibumoso bwacyo isobanurwa ite?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.11",
